# Reproducible visual demo of the community quickstart (VHS: https://github.com/charmbracelet/vhs).
# Render from the unpacked release directory:  vhs docs/community/quickstart-demo.tape
Output docs/community/quickstart-demo.gif
Set FontSize 16
Set Width 1200
Set Height 700
Type "./community-quickstart.sh run"
Enter
Sleep 30s
